.PP 
.SS "boolean animationHasTag (object pose, string object, string tag)"

.PP
Test sampled animation metadata for a tag\&. Reads an owned snapshot without changing playback\&. Object and tag names are exact and case-sensitive\&. Missing objects/tags return false; an invalid snapshot or non-string names throw\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpose\fP Snapshot returned by \fBSprite\&.getAnimationPose()\fP or sampleAnimationPose()\&. 
.br
\fIobject\fP Authored object name, or an empty string for entity metadata\&. 
.br
\fItag\fP Tag name to find\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True if the selected object's sampled tag set contains the name\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBExample\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
const touching = pdg\&.animationHasTag(sprite\&.getAnimationPose(), 'hand', 'contact');

.fi
.PP
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBSprite::getAnimationPose()\fP, \fBAnimationContactTarget::update()\fP 
.RE
.PP

